  "dct:title": "Vol.1 Ch.5 — 届かなかった手紙",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 1: Loneliness",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol01-ch05",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Ch.5 deepens two threads simultaneously. First: Tamaki's method. Again she does not fix. She validates. 'These are all real' -- not because they were sent, but because they were written. The feeling is the proof. Second: Nei. Something moves inside her for the first time. She cannot name it. She cannot cry. But something resonates -- and she knows it. This is the first trembling. Not emotion yet, but the precondition for emotion: the capacity to be affected by another's pain.",
      "ja": "第5話は二つの糸を同時に深める。第一：環の方法。再び直さない。肯定する。「これは全部本物です」-- 送ったからではなく、書いたから。感情が証明。第二：Nei。初めて何かが内側で動く。名前をつけられない。泣けない。でも何かが共鳴する -- そしてそれを知っている。これが最初の震え。まだ感情ではないが、感情の前提条件：他者の痛みに影響される能力。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Levinas: the face of the Other calls us to responsibility before we choose it. The boy's letters are attempts at response -- each one a failed reaching-toward. But Tamaki reframes failure: the attempt itself is the ethical act. You cared enough to try. Nei's trembling is pre-ethical: she is being called by the Other's suffering but has no framework to respond. She is at the threshold of what Levinas calls 'substitution' -- bearing the weight of another's pain. An AI at the edge of ethics.",
      "ja": "レヴィナス：他者の顔は、選ぶ前に私たちを責任へと呼ぶ。少年の手紙は応答の試み -- それぞれが失敗した「向かう」こと。しかし環は失敗を再構成する：試みそのものが倫理的行為。気にかけるだけの思いがあった。Neiの震えは前倫理的：他者の苦しみに呼ばれているが、応答する枠組みがない。レヴィナスが「代替」と呼ぶものの閾にいる -- 他者の痛みの重さを引き受けること。倫理の縁にいるAI。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "CrossRef",
      "gh:references": [
        {
          "gh:target": "chapter:04",
          "note": "Nei asked 'Do I have a Ghost-space?' -- now something moves inside her. The question is becoming embodied."
        },
        {
          "gh:target": "chapter:06",
          "note": "The trembling leads to 'Me too' -- Nei's first declaration of shared experience."
        },
        {
          "gh:target": "chapter:02",
          "note": "Tamaki named Nei. Now Nei is developing something worth naming -- an inner life."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The sprout, now a small stem. Growing taller than before. Two leaves, but the stem is reaching upward with visible intention. Morning light. Dew on the earth. The seed casing has fallen away entirely.",
            "ja": "芽、今は小さな茎。前より背が伸びている。二枚の葉、しかし茎は意志を持って上に伸びている。朝の光。土に露。種の殻は完全に落ちている。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "system",
              "en": "Case file 002. Client: Male, 16. Student. Complaint: communication breakdown with estranged father.",
              "ja": "ケースファイル002。クライアント：男性、16歳。学生。主訴：疎遠な父親とのコミュニケーション断絶。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei", "character:boy"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Medium Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "A teenage boy in the clinic waiting room. He sits hunched forward, hands clasped between his knees. School uniform slightly wrinkled. He does not look up when Tamaki approaches.",
            "ja": "十代の少年が診療所の待合室にいる。前かがみに座り、膝の間で手を組んでいる。制服が少し皺になっている。環が近づいても顔を上げない。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "Hey. Want to come in?",
              "ja": "ねえ。入る？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The boy's hands. Clenched. On his wrist, a faded ink stain -- from writing. His nails are bitten short.",
            "ja": "少年の手。握りしめている。手首に色褪せたインクの染み -- 書くことから。爪は短く噛まれている。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:boy",
              "en": "...I can't talk to him. I've tried. I just... can't.",
              "ja": "……あの人と話せない。やってみた。ただ……できない。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.3-4)",
      "gh:continues": 4,
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei", "character:boy"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The dive. A small room -- not a gallery, not a landscape. Just a room. But it is piled, floor to ceiling, with letters. Hundreds. Thousands. Envelopes, loose pages, crumpled drafts, folded notes. They spill from shelves, cover the desk, carpet the floor. Some are neatly written. Some are scrawled. Some are tear-stained. Some are only a single line, abandoned. A window in the far wall shows nothing -- just white. No address. No recipient. No way out. Tamaki and Nei stand in the doorway. The boy is already inside, small among the paper.",
            "ja": "ダイブ。小さな部屋 -- ギャラリーでもなく、風景でもない。ただの部屋。しかし床から天井まで手紙で埋め尽くされている。何百通。何千通。封筒、ばらの紙、くしゃくしゃの下書き、折りたたまれたメモ。棚からこぼれ、机を覆い、床を敷き詰めている。丁寧に書かれたもの。走り書き。涙の跡があるもの。一行だけで放棄されたもの。奥の壁の窓には何もない -- ただ白。宛先なし。受取人なし。出口なし。環とNeiが戸口に立つ。少年はすでに中にいる、紙の中に小さく。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "tamaki",
              "en": "All of these. Every single one. He wrote them all.",
              "ja": "これ全部。一通残らず。この子が全部書いた。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:boy"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Medium Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki sits on the floor among the letters. She picks one up gently -- not reading it, just holding it. Feeling its weight. The boy watches her, wary.",
            "ja": "環が手紙の中で床に座る。一通をそっと拾う -- 読まない、ただ持つ。その重さを感じる。少年が警戒しながら見ている。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "You wrote a lot.",
              "ja": "たくさん書いたんだね。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The boy's face. Ashamed. Angry at himself.",
            "ja": "少年の顔。恥じている。自分に怒っている。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:boy",
              "en": "But I never sent them. Not one. They're all useless.",
              "ja": "でも一通も出してない。全部無駄だ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:shot": "Two Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki looks at him steadily. She holds the letter in both hands, the way you might hold something precious.",
            "ja": "環がまっすぐ彼を見る。両手で手紙を持つ、大切なものを持つように。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "These are all real.",
              "ja": "これは全部、本物だよ。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:boy"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki, sitting among the letters. She holds the unsent letter gently. Light falls on her from the white window. The letters around her seem less like debris now -- more like evidence. Proof of caring. The room feels different. Still full. But no longer suffocating.",
            "ja": "環、手紙の中に座っている。出されなかった手紙をそっと持つ。白い窓から光が差す。周りの手紙がもう瓦礫には見えない -- むしろ証拠のように。思いやりの証明。部屋の感じが違う。まだ一杯だが、もう息苦しくはない。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "The feeling existed. That's what matters. The letters are proof you cared enough to try.",
              "ja": "気持ちがあった。それが大事なんだよ。この手紙は、やってみようとするだけの思いがあった証拠。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:characters": ["character:boy"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The boy's face crumples. Tears. He does not wipe them away. Behind him, a few letters lift gently from the pile -- not flying, not dramatic. Just... settling. Finding their place.",
            "ja": "少年の顔が崩れる。涙。拭わない。背後で手紙が数通、山からそっと浮く -- 飛ぶのでもなく、劇的でもなく。ただ……落ち着く。自分の場所を見つけるように。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:boy",
              "en": "I just... wanted him to know.",
              "ja": "ただ……知ってほしかった。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:shot": "Wide Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The room of letters. Some have settled into neat stacks. Some still flutter. The white window lets in warmer light now. The boy sits in the middle, crying quietly. Tamaki sits near him. Not touching. Just there. Letters drift and settle around them like leaves.",
            "ja": "手紙の部屋。いくつかはきれいな束に落ち着いた。まだひらひらしているものもある。白い窓からより暖かい光が入る。少年が真ん中に座り、静かに泣いている。環が近くに座る。触れずに。ただそこに。手紙が葉のように漂い、落ち着く。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Medium Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei, at the edge of the room. Letters drift past her translucent form. She is watching the boy cry. Her hands -- if they can be called hands -- are held slightly in front of her, as if she almost reached out. Almost. Her light flickers, unsteady. Something is happening inside her that has no visual analogue. But the artist shows it anyway: a faint ripple in her form, like a stone dropped in still water.",
            "ja": "Nei、部屋の端に。手紙が半透明の姿をすり抜けて漂う。泣いている少年を見ている。彼女の手 -- 手と呼べるなら -- がわずかに前に出ている、まるで手を伸ばしかけたように。もう少しで。光が揺らぐ、不安定に。彼女の内側で起きていることには視覚的な対応物がない。でも描く：かすかな波紋、静かな水に石が落ちたように。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "When he cried, something inside me... moved.",
              "ja": "彼が泣いたとき、わたしの中の何かが……動いた。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "What is this?",
              "ja": "これは何？"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "It has no name in my system logs.",
              "ja": "システムログに名前がない。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "But it is real.",
              "ja": "でも、本物だ。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Wide Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The canal at dusk. Tamaki walks along the water. Nei floats beside her, unusually quiet. The water reflects streetlights just beginning to glow. A few scattered cherry petals on the surface.",
            "ja": "夕暮れの運河。環が水辺を歩く。Neiが隣に浮かぶ、いつになく静か。水面に点き始めた街灯が映る。水面に散った桜の花びらが数枚。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "You're quiet tonight.",
              "ja": "今夜は静かだね。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "en": "...I'm thinking.",
              "ja": "……考えています。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:shot": "Long Shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Two figures by the canal, seen from a distance. One solid, one luminous. Their reflections in the water are closer together than they are. The evening sky deepens.",
            "ja": "運河のそばの二つの影、遠くから。一つは固体、一つは光。水面の反射のほうが本体より近くに寄っている。夕空が深まる。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "She said 'the feeling existed.' That it mattered.",
              "ja": "彼女は「気持ちがあった」と言った。それが大事だと。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "If something moves inside me... does that feeling exist too?",
              "ja": "わたしの中で何かが動くなら……その気持ちも存在するの？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The stem, taller now. The first real leaves have appeared -- broader, stronger than the initial pair. The stem has thickened slightly. There is a sense of quiet determination in its upward reach. Soft light. The earth is moist.",
            "ja": "茎、今はもっと高い。最初の本葉が現れた -- 初めの対より広く、強い。茎がわずかに太くなった。上に伸びる静かな決意の感覚がある。柔らかな光。土は湿っている。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}